A <physicist>.https://www.oeaw.ac.at/gedenkbuch/personen/a-h/victor-hess/[Independent biographical identity and professional specialization]{ref}

The <Hess cosmic-ray balloon experiment> examines how measured air ionization changes with altitude. Inferring an extraterrestrial source requires separating that signal from the detector response and from radiation associated with the ground.

